## Why This Is Asked
Tests privacy-preserving ML at scale with regulatory constraints, multi-tenant isolation, and production-grade governance. Requires knowledge of Vertex AI Confidential Computing, Dataflow pipelines, Data Catalog/DLP, and automated rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Vertex AI Confidential Computing (VMs/TPUs)
- Dataflow ingestion and residency controls
- Private endpoints and per-tenant budgets
- Data Catalog governance and DLP coverage
- Adversarial robustness testing and dataset/versioning

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: basic adversarial test harness
function evalAdversarial(model, sample) {
  const adv = generateAdversarialSample(sample);
  const pred = model.predict(adv);
  return pred.accuracy;
}
```

